<!--
  App Store (external-signing) entitlements for the Engine Process appex.

  Intentionally empty: App Store binaries are re-signed by Apple with the
  provisioning profile, and Metal/IOKit is available to normally-signed
  apps without private entitlements. Private IOKit/no-sandbox entitlements
  live only in EngineProcess.private.entitlements for the TrollStore TIPA
  (see the comment there for the real-device GPU-process rationale).
-->
